## 🔌 Electronics Architecture

The Robodog follows a **distributed electronics architecture**, separating high-level computation, real-time control, sensing, actuation, power management, and communication. This improves reliability, reduces processing load on individual controllers, and allows the system to be expanded with additional sensors and modules.

